    "id": "job-2025-lgd-shorthand-typist-q13",
    "examId": "job-2025-lgd-shorthand-typist",
    "subject": "math",
    "topic": "বীজগণিত",
    "qno": 13,
    "marks": 5,
    "type": "math",
    "question": "a = √3 + √2 হলে, a³ + 3a + 3a⁻¹ + a⁻³ এর মান কত?",
    "steps": [
      "দেওয়া আছে, a = √3 + √2",
      "1/a = 1/(√3 + √2) = (√3 − √2)/{(√3 + √2)(√3 − √2)} [লব ও হরকে (√3 − √2) দ্বারা গুণ করে]",
      "= (√3 − √2)/{(√3)² − (√2)²}",
      "= (√3 − √2)/(3 − 2)",
      "= √3 − √2",
      "∴ a + 1/a = (√3 + √2) + (√3 − √2) = 2√3",
      "প্রদত্ত রাশি: a³ + 3a + 3a⁻¹ + a⁻³",
      "= a³ + a⁻³ + 3a + 3a⁻¹",
      "= a³ + 1/a³ + 3a + 3.1/a",
      "= a³ + 1/a³ + 3(a + 1/a)",
      "= (a + 1/a)³ − 3.a.1/a (a + 1/a) + 3(a + 1/a)",
      "= (2√3)³"
    ],
    "answer": "= 24√3"
  },
